    "The separately admitted v16 red at c6d0800e reached four primary catalog failures and nine producer-dependent stops. Eight controls and two lifecycle hooks passed. The dependent cases provide no downstream red evidence.",
    "The catalog implementation at 3d466cc6 passed the original ordered 21 v16 cases, 57 credential component cases and 536 controls across 13 exact runners, with reconciled loader/plugin logs and seals. The three exact CTest selections passed. The 95e54d2f promotion enables the catalog suite in the required Qt job.",
    "The v16 catalog adds the exact credential table and implicit index, preserving the v15 prefix. The production-table INSERT and UPDATE RETURNING paths and typed delivery after reopen/reprovision passed locally with synthetic non-root inputs. The measured 1,065,558-byte v16 manifest requires an explicit bounded request. The server and dev CLI continue to select v10.",
    "CRYPTO-01 remains partial. Linux component and same-process reopening evidence do not include real host restart, root and wrong-owner contexts, deployed key mount or memlock capacity, provider or startup integration, rotation, backup/restore or authorized removal/reset (#730)."
